{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09277","headline":"自蒲塘驿廻驾经历山水 · 韦应物","name":"自蒲塘驿廻驾经历山水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"馆宿风雨滞，始晴行盖转。\n浔阳山水多，草木俱纷衍。\n崎岖缘碧涧，苍翠践苔藓。\n高树夹潺湲，崩石横阴巘。\n野杏依寒拆，余云冒岚浅。\n性惬形岂劳，境殊路遗缅。\n忆昔终南下，佳游亦屡展。\n时禽下流暮，纷思何由遣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09277.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09277","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}